<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Sulzer.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Sulzer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG says it has issued a total of two million American-style call warrants, on Sulzer Ltd.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    750.00 SFR		PREMIUM	13.99 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     8.10 SFR		  GEARING	9.0 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 03.OCT.96-16.JAN.98   PAYDATE	30.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  729.00 SFR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
